mo/photo.jpg"],[[null,[[["丸舢 西門店限定｜同名新品 \n《招牌丸舢拉麵》即將登場！\n5/15-5/17限時買一送一\n快快結伴同行 一起吃麵💪\n\n西門店正式營業，隆重推出\n同名新品《招牌丸舢拉麵》\n\n雞、貝、豚，三種湯底合一，\n🍜雞湯的甘甜\n🍜貝湯的鮮美\n🍜豚湯的濃郁\n\n不同以往強調的直球對決，\n這次我們將丸舢的特色\n更多層次的呈現！\n\n搭配五種不同烹飪手法的肉品\n滿足你心中深層的肉食慾望！\n這碗麵中可以同時吃到：\n\n▪️炙燒豬五花\n▪️舒肥豬梅花\n▪️舒肥雞叉燒\n▪️脆皮烤雞腿\n▪️蒜炒豬絞肉\n\n一口湯、一種肉\n吃一碗麵，既在陸地奔跑\n又在海裡暢游😎\n\n五種不同的口感、滋味\n只在➡️丸舢拉麵西門店\n限定發行💪\n-\n招牌丸舢拉麵 買一送一活動\n活動日期：5/15（五晚）-5/17（日）\n限定店舖：西門店\n價格：$330（買一送一）\n活動時間：\n5/15（五）17:00-22:00\n5/17（日）11:30-21:00\n\n備注：\n買一送一活動僅限招牌丸舢拉麵單一品項，且需當下兌換完畢，若單人用餐有食量考量，可與店員溝通麵少或不加麵。\n\n活動為西門店限定，市府店、光華店暫無販售。\n\n以現場銷售情況為主，售完為止！",1]]],[1778525439,1794336639],null,null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipPmS5u5nx3BIUIrdKNkWH3n7371fIs63Zw-jpzu\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipPmS5u5nx3BIUIrdKNkWH3n7371fIs63Zw-jpzu"]],"2086101072029223245","15747895986627320237",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003d4665041cdc874088\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003dzh-TW\u0026gl\u003dtw\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026q\u003d%E4%B8%B8%E8%88%A2%E6%8B%89%E9%BA%B5+%E5%85%89%E8%8F%AF%E5%BA%97\u0026ludocid\u003d3624871706079393108\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKELf-_oGKkMXPBA\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKELf-_oGKkMXPBA,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F-%2Flocations%2F15747895986627320237%2FlocalPosts%2F2086101072029223245/version/1778525439530000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCM2S9J71u9T5HBIWQ0lITTBvZ0tFTGYtX29HS2tNWFBCQRoTQ2d3SV84bUkwQVlRNEtfV2x3TQ\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003d%E4%B8%B8%E8%88%A2%E6%8B%89%E9%BA%B5+%E5%85%89%E8%8F%AF%E5%BA%97\u0026ludocid\u003d3624871706079393108\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKELf-_oGKkMXPBA\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5V4eWLtHiwxnQcnBVNzMiYH","0ahUKEwj_qaeU49GWAxWwg68BHaDiDckQ544CCIIDKDU",null,"2026年5月12日",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u15747895986627320237/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChMyMDg2MTAxMDcyMDI5MjIzMjQ1","https://business.g