你推薦哪道料理？",null,[null,[1]],null,"建議的餐點",null,"0ahUKEwj_qaeU49GWAxWwg68BHaDiDckQ3IcHCMkBKBk",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["年前剛放假還沒除夕前來吃的，之前看到排隊的人潮有點卻步！\n餐點選了特製雞貝鹽拉麵、麵條選手打粗麵，入座前交代硬麵，\n環境乾淨舒適，水很冰涼！\n餐點上桌唆了一口！粗麵口感很好，跟湯也很適配！\n湯頭只能說不愧是源自二屋牡蠣麵的店家、鹽味湯頭乾淨清澈有水準，不僅味美清香甘美食材完全提鮮、所有叉燒都是軟嫩不柴！雞肉有炙燒增香的塊狀叉燒跟舒肥雞胸片。貝類是干貝，雖然個頭不大還好、口感軟糯新鮮，干貝表面有經過炙燒的加持後香味顯得特別濃郁！續麵雖然只有細麵，麵條也同樣頗具水準！硬的麵管夠不怕續，店家只在乎有你有沒有吃飽！續麵後加了特製七味粉來轉換口味真是棒！要不是有稍稍節制，會忍不住想再續麵！\n買單前親切的店員解釋大量豆芽菜是為了豚骨拉麵而準備的！看著店員賣力的甩瀝乾麵條水分，有再再回訪的理由！",null,[0,70]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15747895986627320237/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBTZUZKRmJEUlhiVXBIVlVaYVRWRXpiRmxXTW5Cb1pVUnNlR0l6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15747895986627320237/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBTZUZKRmJEUlhiVXBIVlVaYVRWRXpiRmxXTW5Cb1pVUnNlR0l6WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15747895986627320237/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBTZUZKRmJEUlhiVXBIVlVaYVRWRXpiRmxXTW5Cb1pVUnNlR0l6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15747895986627320237/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBTZUZKRmJEUlhiVXBIVlVaYVRWRXpiRmxXTW5Cb1pVUnNlR0l6WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15747895986627320237/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBTZUZKRmJEUlhiVXBIVlVaYVRWRXpiRmxXTW5Cb1pVUnNlR0l6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15747895986627320237/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBTZUZKRmJEUlhiVXBIVlVaYVRWRXpiRmxXTW5Cb1pVUnNlR0l6WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,36010,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pSeFJFbDRXbUpHVUZaTVEzbFlWMnBoZURseGIzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x324e219c7d39f554!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjRxREl4WmJGUFZMQ3lYV2pheDlxb3c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.g